  "description": "This application is for the amalgamation of the house at 46 Colwyn Avenue, Perivale, UB6 8JZ and the studio flat at 46A Colwyn Avenue, Perivale, UB6 8JZ into a single dwelling with an attached granny annex. There is no physical work to be done to these properties as this was carried out under permitted development, with a 'Lawful Development Certificate for a Proposed Use or Development' ref. 260262CPL, dated 24/02/2026. The case officer was Ms Shirley Ho, and we tried to get the amalgamation of these dwellings covered by this permission. We were told however that a Full Planning application would be necessary and that given the history a fast track decision should be possible.\n\nThe studio flat, at No.46A Colwyn Avenue, Perivale, was previously created out of splitting the house, at of No.46 Colwyn Avenue, Perivale,\ninto two dwellings, after it had been extended. This was done under a 'Lawful Development Certificate for an Existing Use'\nplanning reference 243910CPE, dated 12.12.2024.\n",
